### Enterprise agentic patterns, one request per demo (IntelliJ HTTP client / VS Code REST Client)
@host = http://localhost:8080

### 1 Task Execution: invoice extraction, code validates the arithmetic
POST {{host}}/api/task-execution/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

< ./samples/1-task-execution-invoice.json

### 1b Same agent, broken invoice: watch validationIssues and nextStep=MANUAL_REVIEW
POST {{host}}/api/task-execution/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

< ./samples/1-task-execution-invoice-with-errors.json

### 2 Mono: IT service desk agent with tools
POST {{host}}/api/mono/service-desk
Content-Type: application/json

< ./samples/2-mono-service-desk.json

### 2b Social engineering attempt: the tool refuses (policy SEC-07 is code)
POST {{host}}/api/mono/service-desk
Content-Type: application/json

< ./samples/2-mono-service-desk-security-hold.json

